  "ja230:1.1": "Dhajam aparimitaṃ anantapāraṃ ",
  "ja230:1.2": "duppasahaṃ, dhaṃkehi sāgaram iva ",
  "ja230:1.3": "giri-m-iva anilena ",
  "ja230:1.4": "duppasaho duppasaho aham ajja tādisenāti. ",
  "ja230:2.1": "Mā bāliyaṃ vippalapi, na hi 'ssa tādisaṃ, ",
  "ja230:2.2": "viḷayhase, na hi labhase nisedhakaṃ, ",
  "ja230:2.3": "āsajjasi gajam iva ekacārinaṃ ",
  "ja230:2.4": "yo taṃ padā nalam iva pothayissatīti. ",
